            Who Is Liable When an AI Agent Fails, and What It Takes to Show What Happened
          </h1>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-1">
            <span>Essay · Regulatory</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>8 min read</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <time datetime="2026-06-29">June 2026</time>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ BODY ══════════ -->
    <section class="border-t border-line-0">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 md:border-x md:border-line-0">
